Having worked closely with @DylanAbruscato, @johncoogan, @jordihays, and the TBPN team over the past year, I couldn't be more excited to see @OpenAI supporting new media in such a big way. AI is moving fast, and the old communications playbook just isn’t enough. We need to support better ways for people to follow what’s happening, understand what matters, and hear directly from the people building this technology.

TBPN has already cracked a lot of that, and I can't wait to see where we go from here. It's important to note that TBPN will keep its editorial independence. They’ll continue running their programming, choosing guests, and making their own decisions. That independence is core to why people trust them, and we’re protecting that explicitly.

@jordihays: "TBPN has been acquired by OpenAI. The world is changing quickly, but TBPN will stay the same. Live every weekday, just with a lot more resources. Thank you to everyone that has been a part of this journey, big or small. We are 17 months in and unironically just getting started."

